"Magic distinguishes mind from brain: a Healer of Body fixes a head injury, not the mind."
"A Healer of Mind restores memory, corrects lingering Sway damage, and can reset after trauma."
"They can work with Sways to lock in personality changes a patient wants."
"Earth's Avowed Healers of Mind rarely read thoughts; some services use Sway helpers."
"Artonan mind healers are more diverse and personalized, and can easily read thoughts."
"Artonan mind healers are very unlikely to exceed the actions discussed beforehand."
"They never push against resistance or unwillingness, unless others are put at risk."
"The smallest tendril of curiosity or openness in the patient may be encouraged."
"A change is made when the patient is sure it would be better and the healer agrees it will not harm."
"Patients should choose hurts they understand best, not those that ache most."
"A nightmare can be replaced by a new dream the patient crafts, one that recurs instead."
"A healer violating the agreement is in breach of Contract."
